{"code":"zh","name":"Chinese","native":"中文","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: 了/过, ability, places, food","goals":["Talk about past with 了 and 过","Express ability with 会/能/可以","Move around, eat out and shop"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and ability","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"了 and 过","learn":"Past helpers! Verb + 了 (completed): 我吃了 (I ate). Didn't: 没吃 (NOT 不吃 for past!). Experience: 过 (have done): 我吃过 (I've eaten before). 已经 = already!","vocab":[{"t":"昨天","r":"zuó tiān","en":"yesterday","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"今天","r":"jīn tiān","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"明天","r":"míng tiān","en":"tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"早上","r":"zǎo shang","en":"morning","pos":"noun"},{"t":"晚上","r":"wǎn shang","en":"evening","pos":"noun"},{"t":"夜里","r":"yè lǐ","en":"at night","pos":"noun"},{"t":"然后","r":"rán hòu","en":"then","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"已经","r":"yǐ jīng","en":"already","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Verb了 · 没verb · Verb过","explain":"我吃了 (I ate), 我没吃 (I didn't eat), 我吃过 (I've eaten before). 没 = past-negative! 过 = ever-experience!","pattern":"了 (done) · 没 (didn't) · 过 (ever)","examples":[{"t":"昨天我读了书。","r":"zuó tiān wǒ dú le shū.","en":"Yesterday I read a book."},{"t":"我没吃。","r":"wǒ méi chī.","en":"I didn't eat."},{"t":"我吃过北京烤鸭!","r":"wǒ chī guo Běi jīng kǎo yā!","en":"I've eaten Peking duck!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 不吃 for past — past-negative: 没吃!","Saying 吃了过 — pick ONE: 了 or 过!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"昨天你做什么了?","r":"zuó tiān nǐ zuò shén me le?","en":"What did you do yesterday?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我学习了。然后玩了!","r":"wǒ xué xí le. rán hòu wán le!","en":"I studied. Then I played!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我工作了。","r":"wǒ gōng zuò le.","en":"I worked."},{"sp":"小红","t":"辛苦了!","r":"xīn kǔ le!","en":"Good work!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"昨天我读了书"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___吃。 (didn't)","answer":"没"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I've eaten Peking duck' is…","options":["我吃北京烤鸭","我吃过北京烤鸭","我吃了过北京烤鸭","我没吃北京烤鸭"],"answer":"我吃过北京烤鸭"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 读了书 / 我 / 昨天","answer":"昨天我读了书"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 昨天我读了书。","answer":"昨天我读了书。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"吃了 means…","options":["eat","ate","don't eat","will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"了 = completed."},{"q":"没吃 means…","options":["don't eat (habit)","didn't eat","won't eat","can't eat"],"answer":1,"why":"没 = past-negative."},{"q":"吃过 means…","options":["ate (once)","have eaten before","want eat","eating now"],"answer":1,"why":"过 = experience."},{"q":"昨天 means…","options":["today","yesterday","tomorrow","tonight"],"answer":1,"why":"昨天 = yesterday."},{"q":"然后 means…","options":["before","then","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"然后 = then."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"了/过 worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["yesterday","already","then"],"key":["昨天","已经","然后"]},{"instruction":"了/没/过.","items":["I read (a book, done)","I didn't eat","I've eaten Peking duck"],"key":["我读了书","我没吃","我吃过北京烤鸭"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["What did you do yesterday?","Good work!"],"key":["昨天你做什么了","辛苦了"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"会/能/可以 + 想/要","learn":"Three CANS! 会 (learned skill: 我会说中文), 能 (able: 我能去), 可以 (may/allowed: 可以进来吗?). Wants: 想 (would like), 要 (want/will). 想喝茶 (I'd like tea), 我要走了 (I'm leaving)!","vocab":[{"t":"会","r":"huì","en":"can (learned skill)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"能","r":"néng","en":"can (able)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"可以","r":"kě yǐ","en":"may / can","pos":"verb"},{"t":"想","r":"xiǎng","en":"would like / miss","pos":"verb"},{"t":"要","r":"yào","en":"want / will","pos":"verb"},{"t":"喜欢","r":"xǐ huan","en":"to like","pos":"verb"},{"t":"希望","r":"xī wàng","en":"to hope","pos":"verb"},{"t":"懂","r":"dǒng","en":"to understand","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"会/能/可以 + 想/要","explain":"我会游泳 (I can swim — learned), 我能来 (I can come — able), 可以坐吗? (may I sit?). 想吃 (would like to eat), 我要茶 (I want tea / I'll have tea)!","pattern":"会 (skill) · 能 (able) · 可以 (may)","examples":[{"t":"我会说中文。","r":"wǒ huì shuō Zhōng wén.","en":"I can speak Chinese."},{"t":"我能去。","r":"wǒ néng qù.","en":"I can go."},{"t":"我想喝茶!","r":"wǒ xiǎng hē chá!","en":"I'd like tea!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 我能说中文 for skills — skills: 会!","Saying 我要想 — pick ONE: 想 or 要!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你会说中文吗?","r":"nǐ huì shuō Zhōng wén ma?","en":"Can you speak Chinese?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"会一点! 你呢?","r":"huì yì diǎn! nǐ ne?","en":"A little! And you?"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我也想学!","r":"wǒ yě xiǎng xué!","en":"I'd like to learn too!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"一起学吧!","r":"yì qǐ xué ba!","en":"Let's learn together!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I can speak Chinese","answer":"我会说中文"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___喝茶! (would like)","answer":"想"},{"type":"choose","q":"'May I sit?' is…","options":["我会坐吗","我能坐吗","可以坐吗","我想坐了"],"answer":"可以坐吗"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 中文 / 会说 / 我","answer":"我会说中文"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我会说中文。","answer":"我会说中文。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"会 means…","options":["able now","can (learned skill)","may","want"],"answer":1,"why":"会 = learned ability."},{"q":"能 means…","options":["learned skill","able / capable","may","want"],"answer":1,"why":"能 = able."},{"q":"可以坐吗? asks…","options":["can you sit","may I sit","do you sit","sit down!"],"answer":1,"why":"可以 = permission."},{"q":"想 means…","options":["want (firm)","would like / miss","must","may"],"answer":1,"why":"想 = soft want + miss."},{"q":"懂 means…","options":["know-fact","understand","forget","remember"],"answer":1,"why":"懂 = understand."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Ability worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["can (skill)","can (able)","would like"],"key":["会","能","想"]},{"instruction":"Cans and wants.","items":["I can speak Chinese","I can go","I'd like tea"],"key":["我会说中文","我能去","我想喝茶"]},{"instruction":"Learn together.","items":["I'd like to learn too!","Let's learn together!"],"key":["我也想学","一起学吧"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Places and movement","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"在/去/从…到","learn":"Move! 在 (at), 去 (go to), 从…到 (from…to): 从家到学校 (from home to school). 这里/那里/哪里 = here/there/where! 你去哪里? = Where are you going?","vocab":[{"t":"城市","r":"chéng shì","en":"city","pos":"noun"},{"t":"路","r":"lù","en":"street / road","pos":"noun"},{"t":"商店","r":"shāng diàn","en":"shop","pos":"noun"},{"t":"工作","r":"gōng zuò","en":"work","pos":"verb"},{"t":"公园","r":"gōng yuán","en":"park","pos":"noun"},{"t":"博物馆","r":"bó wù guǎn","en":"museum","pos":"noun"},{"t":"车站","r":"chē zhàn","en":"station","pos":"noun"},{"t":"这里","r":"zhè lǐ","en":"here","pos":"pronoun"}],"grammar":{"title":"在 · 去 · 从…到","explain":"我在家 (I'm at home), 我去学校 (I go to school), 从北京到上海 (from Beijing to Shanghai). Verbs of going demand 去!","pattern":"在 (at) · 去 (to) · 从…到","examples":[{"t":"我在家。","r":"wǒ zài jiā.","en":"I'm at home."},{"t":"我去学校。","r":"wǒ qù xué xiào.","en":"I go to school."},{"t":"从家到学校。","r":"cóng jiā dào xué xiào.","en":"From home to school."}],"mistakes":["Saying 我在去学校 — going: 我去学校!","Saying 我去在家 — at-home: 我在家!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你去哪里?","r":"nǐ qù nǎ lǐ?","en":"Where are you going?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我去学校!","r":"wǒ qù xué xiào!","en":"I go to school!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我去商店。","r":"wǒ qù shāng diàn.","en":"I go to the shop."},{"sp":"小明","t":"路上小心!","r":"lù shang xiǎo xīn!","en":"Be careful on the road!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go to school","answer":"我去学校"},{"type":"fill","q":"我___家。 (at)","answer":"在"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Where are you going?' is…","options":["你在哪里","你去哪里","哪里是你","你是什么地方"],"answer":"你去哪里"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 学校 / 我去","answer":"我去学校"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我去学校。","answer":"我去学校。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"去 marks…","options":["being-at","going-to","coming-from","staying"],"answer":1,"why":"去 = go to."},{"q":"在 marks…","options":["going","being-at","coming","leaving"],"answer":1,"why":"在 = at."},{"q":"从…到 means…","options":["to…and","from…to","at…and","near…and"],"answer":1,"why":"从家到学校."},{"q":"车站 means…","options":["museum","station","school","park"],"answer":1,"why":"车站 = station."},{"q":"哪里 asks…","options":["what","where","when","who"],"answer":1,"why":"哪里 = where."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Places worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["city","park","here"],"key":["城市","公园","这里"]},{"instruction":"在/去/从…到.","items":["I'm at home","I go to school","From home to school"],"key":["我在家","我去学校","从家到学校"]},{"instruction":"Going out.","items":["Where are you going?","Be careful on the road!"],"key":["你去哪里","路上小心"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"去/来/回 + 点","learn":"Move! 去 (go), 来 (come), 回 (return). Time + 点: 六点 (6 o'clock), 六点半 (6:30). 明天我去北京 = Tomorrow I go to Beijing. Leaving: 我走了! Back: 我回来了!!","vocab":[{"t":"去","r":"qù","en":"to go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"来","r":"lái","en":"to come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"回","r":"huí","en":"to return","pos":"verb"},{"t":"北京","r":"Běi jīng","en":"Beijing","pos":"noun"},{"t":"中国","r":"Zhōng guó","en":"China","pos":"noun"},{"t":"家","r":"jiā","en":"home","pos":"noun"},{"t":"桌子","r":"zhuō zi","en":"table","pos":"noun"},{"t":"电影","r":"diàn yǐng","en":"movie","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Movement + 点 time","explain":"六点去 (go at 6), 明天来 (come tomorrow). Leaving home: 我走了! Return: 我回来了! Family: 回来了!","pattern":"time + 点 + movement","examples":[{"t":"六点去。","r":"liù diǎn qù.","en":"I go at six."},{"t":"明天我去北京。","r":"míng tiān wǒ qù Běi jīng.","en":"Tomorrow I go to Beijing."},{"t":"我走了!","r":"wǒ zǒu le!","en":"I'm off!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 六去 without 点 — clock-times need 点!","Saying 再见 when leaving home — say 我走了!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小明","t":"我走了!","r":"wǒ zǒu le!","en":"I'm off!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"路上小心!","r":"lù shang xiǎo xīn!","en":"Be careful!"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我回来了!","r":"wǒ huí lái le!","en":"I'm home!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"回来了!","r":"huí lái le!","en":"Welcome back!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I go at six","answer":"六点去"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (I'm off!)","answer":"我走了"},{"type":"choose","q":"Answer to 我回来了 is…","options":["我走了","回来了","路上小心","再见"],"answer":"回来了"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 去 / 六点","answer":"六点去"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我走了!","answer":"我走了!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"我走了! means…","options":["goodbye forever","I'm off","welcome home","good night"],"answer":1,"why":"我走了 = I'm leaving!"},{"q":"我回来了! means…","options":["I'm off","I'm home","welcome","goodbye"],"answer":1,"why":"回来了 = returned!"},{"q":"六点 needs 点 because…","options":["place","clock-time","object","question"],"answer":1,"why":"点 = o'clock."},{"q":"回 means…","options":["to go","to come","to return","to stay"],"answer":2,"why":"回 = return."},{"q":"电影 means…","options":["book","movie","music","game"],"answer":1,"why":"电影 = movie."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Movement worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["to go","to come","home"],"key":["去","来","家"]},{"instruction":"Move with time.","items":["I go at six","Tomorrow I go to Beijing"],"key":["六点去","明天我去北京"]},{"instruction":"Home rituals.","items":["I'm off! / Be careful!","I'm home! / Welcome back!"],"key":["我走了 / 路上小心","我回来了 / 回来了"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"喜欢 / 爱","learn":"Likes! 喜欢鱼 (I like fish), 爱喝茶 (I love tea-drinking). 喜欢 + noun OR verb! 最喜欢 = favorite: 我最喜欢饺子! Order: 我要这个!","vocab":[{"t":"米饭","r":"mǐ fàn","en":"rice","pos":"noun"},{"t":"牛奶","r":"niú nǎi","en":"milk","pos":"noun"},{"t":"奶酪","r":"nǎi lào","en":"cheese","pos":"noun"},{"t":"肉","r":"ròu","en":"meat","pos":"noun"},{"t":"鱼","r":"yú","en":"fish","pos":"noun"},{"t":"苹果","r":"píng guǒ","en":"apple","pos":"noun"},{"t":"茶","r":"chá","en":"tea","pos":"noun"},{"t":"咖啡","r":"kā fēi","en":"coffee","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"喜欢 + noun/verb · 最喜欢","explain":"喜欢鱼 (like fish), 喜欢喝茶 (like drinking tea), 最喜欢饺子 (favorite is dumplings)! 爱 = deep love: 爱你!","pattern":"喜欢/爱 + noun/verb","examples":[{"t":"我喜欢鱼。","r":"wǒ xǐ huan yú.","en":"I like fish."},{"t":"我爱喝茶。","r":"wǒ ài hē chá.","en":"I love (drinking) tea."},{"t":"我最喜欢饺子!","r":"wǒ zuì xǐ huan jiǎo zi!","en":"I like dumplings most!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 很喜欢喜欢 — one 喜欢 only!","Using 爱 for food casually — food: 喜欢, people: 爱!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"你喜欢什么?","r":"nǐ xǐ huan shén me?","en":"What do you like?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我喜欢鱼!","r":"wǒ xǐ huan yú!","en":"I like fish!"},{"sp":"小红","t":"我要茶!","r":"wǒ yào chá!","en":"I want tea! (I'll have tea)"},{"sp":"小明","t":"我也要咖啡!","r":"wǒ yě yào kā fēi!","en":"I want coffee too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like fish","answer":"我喜欢鱼"},{"type":"fill","q":"我要___! (tea)","answer":"茶"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I like dumplings most!' is…","options":["我喜欢饺子","我最喜欢饺子","我爱吃饺子了","我很喜欢饺子吃"],"answer":"我最喜欢饺子"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 鱼 / 我喜欢","answer":"我喜欢鱼"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我喜欢鱼。","answer":"我喜欢鱼。"}],"quiz":[{"q":"喜欢 takes…","options":["nouns only","nouns or verbs","verbs only","nothing"],"answer":1,"why":"喜欢鱼 / 喜欢喝茶!."},{"q":"要茶 means…","options":["like tea","want tea / have tea","drink tea","see tea"],"answer":1,"why":"要 = want/will-have."},{"q":"奶酪 means…","options":["milk","cheese","meat","fish"],"answer":1,"why":"奶酪 = cheese."},{"q":"最喜欢 means…","options":["like","like most / favorite","want","need"],"answer":1,"why":"最 = most."},{"q":"也 means…","options":["too / also","not","please","very"],"answer":0,"why":"我也 = me too."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Likes worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["fish","tea","apple"],"key":["鱼","茶","苹果"]},{"instruction":"Like and want.","items":["I like fish","I want tea","I like dumplings most"],"key":["我喜欢鱼","我要茶","我最喜欢饺子"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["What do you like?","Me too!"],"key":["你喜欢什么","我也"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: 多少钱","learn":"Shop in Chinese! 多少钱? (How much?), 贵 (expensive), 便宜 (cheap). Money: 块/元 (yuan). 这个/那个 = this one/that one. 我要这个 = I'll take this! 太贵了! = Too expensive!","vocab":[{"t":"价格","r":"jià gé","en":"price","pos":"noun"},{"t":"钱","r":"qián","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"块","r":"kuài","en":"yuan (colloquial)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"发票","r":"fā piào","en":"receipt","pos":"noun"},{"t":"打折","r":"dǎ zhé","en":"discount","pos":"noun"},{"t":"贵","r":"guì","en":"expensive","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"便宜","r":"pián yi","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"免费","r":"miǎn fèi","en":"free","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"多少钱? + 这个/那个","explain":"这个多少钱? (How much is this one?), 一百块 (100 yuan). 我要这个! = I'll take this one! 太…了 = too: 太贵了!","pattern":"这个 + 多少钱? · 太 + adj + 了","examples":[{"t":"这个多少钱?","r":"zhè ge duō shao qián?","en":"How much is this one?"},{"t":"一百块。","r":"yì bǎi kuài.","en":"100 yuan."},{"t":"太贵了!","r":"tài guì le!","en":"Too expensive!"}],"mistakes":["Saying 多少 without 钱 — prices: 多少钱!","Saying 这多少钱 — ones: 这个多少钱!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"小红","t":"这个多少钱?","r":"zhè ge duō shao qián?","en":"How much is this one?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"一百块。","r":"yì bǎi kuài.","en":"100 yuan."},{"sp":"小红","t":"太贵了! 奶酪多少钱?","r":"tài guì le! nǎi lào duō shao qián?","en":"Too expensive! How much is the cheese?"},{"sp":"小明","t":"很便宜! 我要这个!","r":"hěn pián yi! wǒ yào zhè ge!","en":"Very cheap! I'll take this one!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is this one?","answer":"这个多少钱"},{"type":"fill","q":"一百___。 (yuan)","answer":"块"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I'll take this one!' is…","options":["我有这个","我要这个","我去这个","我看这个"],"answer":"我要这个"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 多少钱 / 这个","answer":"这个多少钱"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 这个多少钱?","answer":"这个多少钱?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"多少钱? means…","options":["How many?","How much?","Where is?","What is?"],"answer":1,"why":"多少 + 钱 = how much."},{"q":"贵 means…","options":["cheap","expensive","free","new"],"answer":1,"why":"贵 = expensive."},{"q":"便宜 means…","options":["cheap","expensive","tasty","big"],"answer":0,"why":"便宜 = cheap."},{"q":"打折 means…","options":["receipt","discount","price","shop"],"answer":1,"why":"打折 = discount/sale."},{"q":"太贵了 means…","options":["very cheap","too expensive","quite good","a little big"],"answer":1,"why":"太…了 = too!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Shopping worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Chinese.","items":["price","discount","cheap"],"key":["价格","打折","便宜"]},{"instruction":"Shop talk.","items":["How much is this one?","100 yuan","I'll take this one!"],"key":["这个多少钱","一百块","我要这个"]},{"instruction":"React.","items":["Too expensive!","Very cheap!"],"key":["太贵了","很便宜"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"A2 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Yesterday I read a book","answer":"昨天我读了书"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I can speak Chinese","answer":"我会说中文"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I go to school'","options":["我在去学校","我去学校","我去在家","我学校去"],"answer":"我去学校"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"我喜欢鱼。","answer":"I like fish."},{"type":"fill","q":"我___吃。 (didn't)","answer":"没"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I've eaten Peking duck'","options":["我吃北京烤鸭","我吃过北京烤鸭","我吃了过北京烤鸭","我没吃北京烤鸭"],"answer":"我吃过北京烤鸭"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: 去 / 六点","answer":"六点去"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: 我喜欢鱼。","answer":"我喜欢鱼。"},{"type":"fill","q":"这个___? (how much)","answer":"多少钱"},{"type":"choose","q":"我走了!","options":["Welcome home","I'm off","Goodbye forever","Good night"],"answer":"I'm off"}]}}}